  "Main topic of the publication": "This study investigates the role of lysine-specific demethylase 1 (Lsd1) in trophoblast stem cells (TSCs), demonstrating that its inactivation triggers senescence by disrupting energy metabolism and redox balance through increased expression of Sirtuin 4 (Sirt4). The findings suggest that Lsd1 is crucial for stem cell homeostasis and that its dysregulation can lead to aging-related cellular dysfunction.",
